{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Owl_utils_stack</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"owl-base","href":"../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Owl_utils_stack","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Type definition","href":"#type-definition","children":[]},{"title":"Basic functions","href":"#basic-functions","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h6 id=\"type-definition\"><a href=\"#type-definition\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Type definition</h6><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'a t</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Type of a stack.</p></div></div><h6 id=\"basic-functions\"><a href=\"#basic-functions\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Basic functions</h6><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-make\"><a href=\"#val-make\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> make : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>make ()</code> creates an empty stack.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-push\"><a href=\"#val-push\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> push : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>push stack x</code> pushes <code>x</code> into <code>stack</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pop\"><a href=\"#val-pop\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pop : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>pop stack</code> pops the top element in <code>stack</code>. It returns <code>None</code> if the <code>stack</code> is empty.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-peek\"><a href=\"#val-peek\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> peek : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>peek stack</code> returns the value of top element in <code>stack</code> but it does not remove the element from the stack. <code>None</code> is returned if the stack is empty.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_empty\"><a href=\"#val-is_empty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_empty : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Returns <code>true</code> if the stack is empty, otherwise <code>false</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mem\"><a href=\"#val-mem\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mem : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>mem stack x</code> checks whether <code>x</code> exist in <code>stack</code>. The complexity is <code>O(n)</code> where <code>n</code> is the size of the <code>stack</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-memq\"><a href=\"#val-memq\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> memq : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Similar to <code>mem</code> but physical equality is used for comparing values.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_array\"><a href=\"#val-to_array\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_array : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> array</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>to_array stack</code> converts the elements in <code>stack</code> into an array.</p></div></div>"}